CLI.md §3.6, FORMATTER.md §1: a project.canon with a syntax error is reported, exit 1, and nothing at all is written.
-- args --
fmt
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon = "0.1"
}
-- a/a.canon --
package a
let  x:Int=1
const   Y = 60s
-- want --
[exit 1]
[stdout]
error[E1116]  project.canon:2:9
  expected ":"; found =

1 error, 0 warnings in 0 packages (…)
[stderr]
